flowchart LR
  Request --> Intent[Intent + context]
  Intent --> Catalog[Live SQL catalog search]
  Catalog --> Exact{Exact product phrase?}
  Exact -- yes --> Product[Requested product, price, stock]
  Exact -- no --> Category{Generic category?}
  Category -- yes --> Products[Category products]
  Category -- no --> Approx[Approximate alternatives\nnot orderable]
  Product --> RxGate
  Products --> RxGate
  RxGate -- Rx --> PrescriptionLead
  RxGate -- OTC --> Confirmation --> Details[Name + phone + address]
  Details --> CreateOrder --> Transaction[price + stock + order] --> Result
